  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the interplay between courage, responsibility, and wisdom in shaping a champion, as demonstrated through Aiden's narrative.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the text suggest that learning from mistakes is an integral part of personal and athletic development?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Elaborate on the transformation of Aiden's character, highlighting the shift from a thrill-seeker to a mature individual. What prompted this change?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the importance of mentorship and guidance, as exemplified by Aiden's coach's role in his transformation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('49954274-bbba-4b51-8de6-42dbaa1b0bf9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden, a fourteen-year-old state cycling champion from Delta, is preparing for the nationals. His parents, despite their modest means, have invested their savings in an expensive racing cycle for him, recognizing his passion and potential. However, Aiden has developed a dangerous habit of mistaking carelessness for bravery, a concern his family and friends share.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('6c94723a-bfff-49c0-8fe6-a0c6baf0cc7a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$During a school bus ride, Aiden's friends dared him to grab leaves from a low-hanging branch. Aiden, with a confident smile, successfully performed the stunt, eliciting cheers from his friends. The bus driver immediately warned him, but Aiden laughed off the concern, stating, 'A little danger makes it fun! It's all about the thrill, right?'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('5b10fd5c-8f8f-4ca7-afa7-0fba0ae71157', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Imagine Aiden continues to exhibit reckless behavior during his cycling training, believing it makes him fearless. One day, while attempting a risky maneuver to impress onlookers, he suffers a minor injury and damages his expensive racing cycle.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('aef46827-e25d-457b-b428-be7461927b9e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's parents made a significant financial sacrifice to buy him the racing cycle, viewing it as a symbol of 'freedom and possibility.' They are unaware of his recent dangerous stunt on the school bus.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('e5c3a8f9-784c-4d62-a2f9-f8006d113af5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's friends actively encouraged his dangerous act on the bus, cheering him on and reinforcing his belief that 'a little danger makes it fun.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('ada866fb-4e13-494f-a19d-18be42d33bac', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The bus driver, responsible for the safety of all passengers, issued a clear warning to Aiden, which Aiden chose to ignore. The driver must ensure a safe environment on school transport.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('2e238719-cb55-4306-bb4d-d5d7649f89ff', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's coach learns about the bus incident from another student. The nationals are fast approaching, and Aiden is a talented contender, but his recklessness poses a risk to himself and potentially to the team's reputation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('8337bdef-af9b-46ae-9d68-e249271c4765', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's confusion of carelessness with bravery is a recurring theme. This pattern of behavior could jeopardize his future in cycling and his personal safety.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('b68f8938-57fb-4973-9cc9-7ea28d1f40c4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The small town of Delta takes immense pride in Aiden's achievements. News of his reckless behavior could tarnish his image as a role model and set a negative example for younger aspiring athletes.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('00f66672-374e-4cb2-85ff-1e5a9804f014', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's parents discover his dangerous stunt on the bus. They are proud of his talent but deeply worried about his safety and the significant investment they made in his future.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('7bbd0d47-85b8-4827-b103-aac2f4bb2515', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$After a near-miss during a cycling practice, Aiden begins to reflect on the bus incident and the bus driver's warning. He realizes his actions were indeed dangerous and could have led to serious consequences.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('ff9675d5-9bef-4249-a99a-6905825f1a7a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's friends, witnessing the bus driver's genuine concern and perhaps hearing about a local accident, start to question their own role in encouraging Aiden's risky behavior.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('1513e6f2-b0c1-4dcb-a1a1-d82bc877bbe9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The school administration becomes aware of the incident on the bus involving Aiden. They need to address student safety and behavior on school transport, and ensure a safe environment for all.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('d7578072-94bd-40ab-bc6e-4f8076be8193', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A local newspaper, which has been covering Aiden's journey to the nationals, hears whispers of his reckless behavior. They are considering whether to report on this aspect of his character.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('e4d2d5fb-8581-44bd-a976-1c0799ad2778', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$An experienced, retired cyclist from Delta observes Aiden's exceptional talent but also his tendency towards risky behavior. He decides to offer mentorship to Aiden.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('8b9752cc-0219-44cc-961a-2bf853827fba', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The expensive racing cycle, a symbol of his parents' sacrifice, is accidentally damaged due to Aiden's carelessness during a non-sanctioned stunt. His parents, already of modest means, face the burden of repair or replacement.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('9ec4b3b7-492a-4aa4-855b-9eab5fe240a5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's desire for 'thrill' and validation from his friends appears to be a strong motivator for his reckless actions. This suggests a potential underlying psychological aspect to his behavior.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('b6ca55fb-b43b-4297-a3cd-7c35c39dbffd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Inspired by Aiden's incident, the school decides to launch a safety awareness campaign for students regarding behavior on school transport and distinguishing bravery from recklessness.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('001f68c2-0dbc-4797-a334-1cade8d2810d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$If the bus driver had ignored Aiden's actions, and Aiden had continued to escalate his risky behavior on future bus rides, what could be the worst-case scenario?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('88db1d14-f78e-45c8-9be5-d413ee5aa14a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As a state champion, Aiden is a prominent role model for younger children in Delta. His actions on the bus, if widely known, could be mimicked by impressionable younger students.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('8d4e7558-e480-4468-b44b-b76c6f571ae5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's strong desire for 'thrill' could be a powerful asset if channeled correctly. Instead of dangerous stunts, he could direct this energy into challenging but safe aspects of competitive cycling.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('e95458ba-2680-4a17-826d-d59a222aa31a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text states that Aiden's 'family and friends feared' his misconception, implying prior awareness of his reckless tendencies before the bus incident.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('57fa3eb1-0624-43bf-92f6-b495a7e908fd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'Pre-Reading' section prompts readers to reflect on a time when a mistake or setback taught them an important lesson. If Aiden were to engage in such reflection regarding the bus incident, what lesson might he draw?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('fae726c3-39e6-4b32-b2ec-ca35ebecb790', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's core issue is his confusion between carelessness and bravery. This fundamental misunderstanding drives his risky behavior.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('97b3eb72-91ea-479b-9911-4baed9da8097', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A week later, at school, Aiden turned a regular race to the classroom into a daring stunt by jumping up the F stairs two at a time. “Race you to the top!” Aiden shouted, his voice echoing down the hallway. His classmates scrambled after him, but none could keep pace as he bounded up the stairs. Reaching the top, he gasped and turned to his classmates, “Who needs stairs when you can just fly?” Laughing, one classmate replied, “Man, you think you’re some kind of a superhero, don’t you?” “Yeah, exactly!” Aiden exclaimed, enjoying the attention. Feeling encouraged by his previous deeds, Aiden decided to take the biggest risk while cycling with his friends watching. “Check this out!” Aiden exclaimed, letting go of the handlebars. “No hands!” As he trembled slightly but maintained his balance, Aiden thought, “lam the superhero, daring and brave. | dare to do things most people fear attempting. All my friends look up to me.” “Aiden, be careful!” One friend called out, worry creasing his brow. But Aiden, basking in his moment, didn’t listen. When his front wheel struck a rock, the bike shook violently. Aiden scrambled to regain control, but it was too “SN late. \ The bike toppled and Aiden | hit the ground hard. His friends rushed to his § side as he groaned in ri. i pain. “Call an ambulance!” y) One friend cried out, Wf his voice laced with panic. “Hang in there, Aiden. Help is on the way.” In the hospital, with his leg in a cast, reality hit Aiden hard. He wouldn’t be able to participate in the nationals! The dream of becoming a national champion this year was over. As his coach entered the room, tears streamed down Aiden’s face. The floodgates opened and he cried, wept and sobbed on his coach’s shoulder. “I can’t believe | did this to myself,” Aiden cried out, his voice choked with emotion. “All my dreams, just gone!” His coach held him, letting the young cyclist pour out his grief. “It’s tough, | know. But this isn’t the end, Aiden.” Seeing his distress, the coach sat beside him and gently said, “Everything is not lost, Aiden. You have next year. A new Aiden shall participate next year—a wiser cyclist, brave but not careless.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('a70719b0-498d-4ac6-9f76-538063066748', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflecting on his coach’s words through his tears, Aiden replied quietly, “I’ve been acting foolish, haven’t I? I thought I was being brave, but I was just being careless.” As Aiden recovered, he deeply pondered over his coach’s advice. His return to cycling was cautious and measured, focussing not only on physical healing but on understanding the true essence of being a champion—a blend of courage, responsibility and wisdom. When Aiden finally got back on his bike, it was with a newfound respect for its power and his limits. No longer chasing thrills for applause, he pursued excellence with the maturity of a true champion, both on and off the track. He looked forward to the next nationals, not just to compete but to prove to himself and everyone that he had grown— not only as a cyclist but as a person. True bravery is knowing and respecting your limits while working wisely and responsibly, not taking careless risks for thrills. Bravery shines the brightest when paired with responsibility.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
