  ('db03e753-8497-49fe-b2b8-90a9f199da36', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflecting on his coach’s words through his tears, Aiden replied quietly, “I’ve been acting foolish, haven’t I? I thought I was being brave, but I was just being careless.” As Aiden recovered, he deeply pondered over his coach’s advice. His return to cycling was cautious and measured, focussing not only on physical healing but on understanding the true essence of being a champion—a blend of courage, responsibility and wisdom. When Aiden finally got back on his bike, it was with a newfound respect for its power and his limits. No longer chasing thrills for applause, he pursued excellence with the maturity of a true champion, both on and off the track. He looked forward to the next nationals, not just to compete but to prove to himself and everyone that he had grown— not only as a cyclist but as a person. True bravery is knowing and respecting your limits while working wisely and responsibly, not taking careless risks for thrills. Bravery shines the brightest when paired with responsibility.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5cc80f84-daae-4918-8126-46df57b41238', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflecting on his coach’s words through his tears, Aiden replied quietly, “I’ve been acting foolish, haven’t I? I thought I was being brave, but I was just being careless.” As Aiden recovered, he deeply pondered over his coach’s advice. His return to cycling was cautious and measured, focussing not only on physical healing but on understanding the true essence of being a champion—a blend of courage, responsibility and wisdom. When Aiden finally got back on his bike, it was with a newfound respect for its power and his limits. No longer chasing thrills for applause, he pursued excellence with the maturity of a true champion, both on and off the track. He looked forward to the next nationals, not just to compete but to prove to himself and everyone that he had grown— not only as a cyclist but as a person. True bravery is knowing and respecting your limits while working wisely and responsibly, not taking careless risks for thrills. Bravery shines the brightest when paired with responsibility.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0691443b-eb64-402a-ac05-fb025040e2cd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Fine Line Aiden, who lived in a small town named Delta, was known for his exceptional bicycle skills. A state cycling champion at just fourteen, Aiden was preparing for the nationals with dreams larger than his small town. His parents, despite their modest means, recognised his passion and potential and gifted him an expensive racing cycle from the money they had saved up for over the years.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f3617f0e-3f98-4594-8414-59e9394f5664', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden’s new cycle was not just a tool but a symbol of freedom and possibility. It inspired him to take risks, mistaking carelessness for bravery—a misconception his family and friends feared. While riding the school bus with friends one afternoon, Aiden spotted a low-hanging branch from a nearby tree. “Hey, Aiden, think you can grab some leaves off that tree?” one of his friends teased. With a confident smile, he responded, “Just watch me do it!” He successfully grabbed a handful of leaves as his friends erupted in cheers.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3391439d-f24e-47c0-ab5f-5dd3c6ef2dce', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$From the front of the bus, the driver shouted, “Aiden! Keep your hands inside the bus! That’s very dangerous!” Laughing off the driver’s concern, Aiden boasted, “A little danger makes it fun! It’s all about the thrill, right?”$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ca46e5ee-049e-492c-989f-d73d19133ce7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story of Aiden introduces themes of ambition, parental sacrifice, peer influence, and the fine line between bravery and recklessness. It implicitly raises questions about personal responsibility and the consequences of dangerous choices.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c828683b-007a-4745-abfc-387e9d66bf43', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden is portrayed as a highly skilled athlete with significant potential, yet he exhibits a concerning tendency to disregard safety warnings and engage in risky behavior for the sake of excitement and peer approval.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('08038c82-3304-48b8-8945-92c892ba4785', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'Pre-Reading' section asks readers to 'Share a time when a mistake or a setback taught you an important lesson. How did that experience change your approach to challenges in the future?' The 'Learning Outcomes' list goals such as reading with correct pronunciation, learning new words, exploring the theme, and using finite/non-finite verbs.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bb1359d6-10c8-40b9-89a7-9e33e72eaf86', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's parents, despite their 'modest means,' recognized his 'passion and potential' and made a significant financial investment in his future by gifting him an 'expensive racing cycle.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ab763989-270d-4198-a09b-683997932568', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The incident on the school bus involved Aiden being 'teased' by a friend into grabbing leaves from a 'low-hanging branch,' followed by his friends 'erupting in cheers' after his success.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bcfb7b3a-ec07-4f3c-be3d-fbfe46ff9148', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The bus driver's stern warning, 'Aiden! Keep your hands inside the bus! That’s very dangerous!' was met with Aiden 'Laughing off the driver’s concern' and boasting about the 'thrill' of danger.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('e9b38f41-a31c-4ddc-a3f6-643afab057f0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's new cycle was a 'symbol of freedom and possibility,' yet it also 'inspired him to take risks, mistaking carelessness for bravery.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3500d3bd-9c5c-4295-9fe1-fb96e9f72ee8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden, a 'state cycling champion at just fourteen,' was preparing for the 'nationals' with 'dreams larger than his small town.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('13b07643-cad1-4b03-bf41-1bedec9afb25', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text asks the reader, 'Do you think it is wise to try such dangerous acts? How do you stop your friends from trying such acts?'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
