  ('58d96d0a-fbf7-45df-830c-fbf4a1446008', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's friends 'teased' him into grabbing leaves and then 'erupted in cheers' after he succeeded.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('de7621d0-b31c-42ce-931a-f06cb657c5a7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$One learning outcome is to 'learn new words and use them in sentences,' and another is to 'explore and appreciate the theme.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b169f342-f3a4-48eb-9c4e-4bc9fa9227db', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story is titled 'Fine Line Aiden,' and Aiden is described as 'mistaking carelessness for bravery.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('d4ce7d70-e5eb-47c5-8982-65d2a05716b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's actions on the bus were 'very dangerous!' according to the driver, but Aiden 'laughed off the driver’s concern' and boasted about the 'thrill.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4b6c082a-bf51-4717-b099-30f7a8ce5cb8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The racing cycle was a 'symbol of freedom and possibility' for Aiden, yet his 'family and friends feared' his 'misconception' of carelessness for bravery.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('23a3b7fc-a8f0-4c55-8b14-6fa0fd41c50d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden, a 'state cycling champion,' was preparing for the 'nationals,' indicating a high level of competition and dedication required.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('dbe6fe71-d0c8-4fde-a6fa-999373a38e21', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'Pre-Reading' section asks about learning from 'a mistake or a setback,' and the 'Learning Outcomes' include 'answer questions based on the story' and 'explore and appreciate the theme.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('6e3188f5-fed6-4722-80a4-aec81c06367a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Aiden's parents 'recognized his passion and potential' and made a significant sacrifice, while Aiden himself 'mistook carelessness for bravery' and engaged in 'very dangerous' acts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('360a4c06-50ef-4101-8f77-3981103fcd16', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story ends with Aiden 'Laughing off the driver’s concern' and boasting, 'A little danger makes it fun! It’s all about the thrill, right?'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fd2fa420-91ae-45b4-8e0c-cdf681e73c8f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A week later, at school, Aiden turned a regular race to the classroom into a daring stunt by jumping up the F stairs two at a time. “Race you to the top!” Aiden shouted, his voice echoing down the hallway. His classmates scrambled after him, but none could keep pace as he bounded up the stairs. Reaching the top, he gasped and turned to his classmates, “Who needs stairs when you can just fly?” Laughing, one classmate replied, “Man, you think you’re some kind of a superhero, don’t you?” “Yeah, exactly!” Aiden exclaimed, enjoying the attention. Feeling encouraged by his previous deeds, Aiden decided to take the biggest risk while cycling with his friends watching. “Check this out!” Aiden exclaimed, letting go of the handlebars. “No hands!” As he trembled slightly but maintained his balance, Aiden thought, “lam the superhero, daring and brave. | dare to do things most people fear attempting. All my friends look up to me.” “Aiden, be careful!” One friend called out, worry creasing his brow. But Aiden, basking in his moment, didn’t listen. When his front wheel struck a rock, the bike shook violently. Aiden scrambled to regain control, but it was too “SN late. \ The bike toppled and Aiden | hit the ground hard. His friends rushed to his § side as he groaned in ri. i pain. “Call an ambulance!” y) One friend cried out, Wf his voice laced with panic. “Hang in there, Aiden. Help is on the way.” In the hospital, with his leg in a cast, reality hit Aiden hard. He wouldn’t be able to participate in the nationals! The dream of becoming a national champion this year was over. As his coach entered the room, tears streamed down Aiden’s face. The floodgates opened and he cried, wept and sobbed on his coach’s shoulder. “I can’t believe | did this to myself,” Aiden cried out, his voice choked with emotion. “All my dreams, just gone!” His coach held him, letting the young cyclist pour out his grief. “It’s tough, | know. But this isn’t the end, Aiden.” Seeing his distress, the coach sat beside him and gently said, “Everything is not lost, Aiden. You have next year. A new Aiden shall participate next year—a wiser cyclist, brave but not careless.”$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('cb783fd2-9f7d-4346-b69c-7c05738fab0a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e107c69a-8c6c-4ee9-8d69-cc855d314673', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflecting on his coach’s words through his tears, Aiden replied quietly, “I’ve been acting foolish, haven’t I? I thought I was being brave, but I was just being careless.” As Aiden recovered, he deeply pondered over his coach’s advice. His return to cycling was cautious and measured, focussing not only on physical healing but on understanding the true essence of being a champion—a blend of courage, responsibility and wisdom. When Aiden finally got back on his bike, it was with a newfound respect for its power and his limits. No longer chasing thrills for applause, he pursued excellence with the maturity of a true champion, both on and off the track. He looked forward to the next nationals, not just to compete but to prove to himself and everyone that he had grown— not only as a cyclist but as a person. True bravery is knowing and respecting your limits while working wisely and responsibly, not taking careless risks for thrills. Bravery shines the brightest when paired with responsibility.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-085Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
